      "content": "hey so i need some help or maybe just to talk through something bc im kinda freaking out. i was doing that internship at the lab last month and there was that leak in the sector 4 containment—the one they didn't report? i was right in the path of the stream. since then everything has been weird. i keep seeing these colors in the corners of my eyes, like these bright pulsing clouds of red or blue right before things happen. like yesterday i saw this massive red haze right before a guy in a silver sedan slammed into a pole. is this like a neurological thing from the radiation or is there actually something happening with the local probability fields? i feel like i'm seeing the math of the world.",
